VVEERRSSIIOONNSS
       The POSIX.1 specification for ssttrrppttiimmee(3) contains conversion
       specifications using the %%EE or %%OO modifier, while such specifications
       are not given for ggeettddaattee().  In glibc, ggeettddaattee() is implemented using
       ssttrrppttiimmee(3), so that precisely the same conversions are supported by
       both.

